I'm starting to get annoyed with Pestilence.  He's just killed my Valkyrie.
This only a few games after he killed my best-ever Wizard.  Pestilence now
features in three of my top five high scores.

Lessons learned (I hope):

1. Remember to replace the AoY with an AoLS when arriving on Astral.  (I'd
put on the AoY on Fire, to help locate the portal.  For some reason, casting
a forgotten spell stunned me but didn't confuse me, so my scroll of
gold-detection didn't do the trick.)

2. Carry some potions of full healing in main inventory, so as not to waste
turns fishing them out of a bag.

3. Try using conflict next time.  I'd never used it much before, never on
the Planes, but it helped out in a big way on Air.

4. Try playing a neutral character.  I'd saved a wish for a helm of opposite
alignment, in case the first altar I went to happened to be chaotic.  It
turned out to be neutral.

I did have the pleasure of killing Dispater this game though.  It's always
fun to see a new Demon (Lord? Prince?) for the first time.  The
aforementioned wizard met Geryon, but I've yet to see Demogorgon (I'm glad
